# The program keypair is the exception: it is a throwaway localnet identity with no
# funds and no upgrade authority worth stealing, and without it `declare_id!` in
# programs/world/src/lib.rs cannot be deployed by anyone else on the team. A real
# deployment key would never be committed.
!target/
